  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1032837,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Tune: Commodore 64 - A Musical Management Masterpiece!\n\nStep into the vibrant world of football management with *1st Tune*, a unique and charming game exclusively for the Commodore 64! Forget tactical formations and grueling training regimes – here, your success hinges on your musical prowess!\n\nAs manager, you’re tasked with guiding a team through the English leagues, but instead of traditional gameplay, you control your players’ performance through rhythm-based mini-games. Successfully hitting the notes in time with the music boosts your team’s speed, strength, and scoring ability. Miss a beat, and your players falter!\n\nBetween matches, manage your finances, scout for new talent, and deal with unexpected events – all while keeping the crowd entertained with your team’s musical flair. *1st Tune* combines the strategic depth of a football management sim with the addictive challenge of a rhythm game, offering a fresh and innovative experience. Can you lead your team to victory and become a legend in the world of musical football?"
    },
